<Base title="Publish" description="Publish from Studio when a draft is ready." path="/studio/publish">
  <div class="measure prose">
    <p class="kicker"><a href="/studio">Studio</a></p>
    <h1>Publish</h1>
    <p>Publishing a novel, note, or sample uses the signed-in member profile. The public magazine does not keep those drafts. Open Studio after you sign in on the member app, or write the desk from Dispatch.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-pink" href="/login">Sign in</a> <a class="btn btn-blue" href="/dispatch">Dispatch</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
